<p dir="auto">Address is the dev-doc-needed requirements of <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2012727" rel="nofollow">Bug 2012727</a> "action.isEnabled() throws instead of returning the global enabled state" by:</p>
